# Optional RSSHub configuration. Copy to .env.rsshub to enable it.
# Add route-specific cookies and credentials as NAME=value entries.
# Consult https://docs.rsshub.app/ for the variables required by your routes.
# Compose provides NODE_ENV, CACHE_TYPE, and REDIS_URL automatically.
# Apply changes with: docker compose up -d rsshub
# Never commit the populated .env.rsshub file.
